      "extract": "The CFE enabled WHO to mount rapid and sustained responses to 14 separate emergencies in 13 countries and one global response (COVID-19) in 2020. A total of nearly US$ 44 million was released in 2020. Table 1 contains a list of all approved releases by event in 2020. Some 80% of funding released from the CFE went to support just three events in 2020: the two Ebola outbreaks in the Democratic Republic of the Congo",
