      "extract": "The CFE was conceived by Member States and launched in 2015 as a revolving fund. Costs initially incurred against CFE allocations would be reimbursed by donor funding to the WHO emergency response at country level and unspent funds would be returned. In practice, it has proven difficult to raise the level of resources required at country level to sustainably replenish the CFE in this manner. In 2020, approximately",
